{"w": 595.3200073242188, "h": 809.0257568359375, "lines": [{"t": "156", "x": 0.8951488575183035, "y": 0.9742087522985531, "w": 0.03859439108533224, "h": 0.017428414981790374, "c": 1, "size": 12.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Part 4", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.12393667166651151, "w": 0.06881167324518032, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": true}, {"t": "It's quite hard to think of a city that doesn't have a big river running through", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.14841061289869437, "w": 0.771500021068878, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "it. If you think about the major cities in the world, Shanghai, New York,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.1730327992034449, "w": 0.7715872698045659, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "Mumbai, London, they're nearly all built on rivers. When these cities were", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.19750666499284275, "w": 0.7719144269321571, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "established hundreds or even thousands of years ago. The rivers were a big", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.22212885129759327, "w": 0.7713041984071108, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "part of people's lives. In 16th century London, the quickest way to get from", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.24660279252977613, "w": 0.7714131824330053, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "one part of the city to another was by river. But people also used the river for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2712620212419723, "w": 0.7721470560523402, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "fishing, as the water then was relatively clean, and they would also go on", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.2957359624741552, "w": 0.7714348151982582, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "boat trips up and down the river just for pleasure, as a relaxing escape from", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.32035812991820944, "w": 0.7715871672796121, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the noise and bustle of the city streets. But as industries developed and", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3448319957076073, "w": 0.771326138747225, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "popular ations increased, city rivers suffered. The rising number of people", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.36945418201235786, "w": 0.7715746592352479, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "meant there was a huge increase in the amount of sewage discharged into", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.3939280855231482, "w": 0.7714348151982582, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the rivers. Rivers had always been used for this purpose, but when the", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.41855030954929123, "w": 0.7714567555383723, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "number of inhabitants was so small, that wasn't such a problem. However,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.44302417533868904, "w": 0.7720719052612013, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "as cities grew to over a million inhabitants, the impact on the rivers became", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.4676711068769267, "w": 0.7713477715124778, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "more serious. In addition, other types of pollution increased as factories were", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.49214497266632456, "w": 0.7716091076197263, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "built beside the river. and discharge their waste materials into the water. This", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5166188761771149, "w": 0.7715872698045659, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "got worse over time. As recently as 1957, scientists at London's Natural", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5412410624818654, "w": 0.771401802163133, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "History Museum declared that the river Temps was dead in biological terms,", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5657149659926558, "w": 0.7715655345143593, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "as the water was too filthy to support any kind of life. But in recent years, as", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.5903371522974064, "w": 0.7714349177232119, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "rivers lost their industrial function, cities have begun to recognize their true", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6148110558081967, "w": 0.7715663547139897, "h": 0.01882263537038409, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "value and to take steps to clean them up. For example, the river temps is now", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6394332798343397, "w": 0.7715655345143593, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "cleaner than it's been for 150 years. These days, you can see seals swimming", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6639441880311833, "w": 0.7717178865957133, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "in the water. And recently, people had to try to rescue a whale which had got", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.6885664497787187, "w": 0.7720032135421521, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "lost and swam up the river from the sea by mistake. Unfortunately, they", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7130403155681166, "w": 0.7714568580633262, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "didn't succeed, but the problem was disorientation rather than the quality of", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7376625018728672, "w": 0.7715004311686933, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "the water. Then, all around the world, riverside areas are now seen as prime", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.762136367662265, "w": 0.7712388900115371, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "sites. for development. Warehouses that were once used for storing goods", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.7867585539670156, "w": 0.7713075817305863, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "are now being converted into expensive restaurants and also into", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8112324951991984, "w": 0.7715220639339461, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "apartments with river views which are in great demand and sell for", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8358546815039489, "w": 0.7715436966991989, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "astronomical prices. In Los Angeles on the west coast of the USA, an", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8603532925268339, "w": 0.7720785693831986, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "architect has plans to revitalize the banks of the river and to make a park", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.8849754788315843, "w": 0.7712608303516514, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "there which can provide facilities for sports as well as a natural environment", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9094493446209823, "w": 0.7716743134903462, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}, {"t": "for relaxing in. It's also hoped that the riverside can be used for other", "x": 0.11675064998257588, "y": 0.9340716063685178, "w": 0.7712390950614447, "h": 0.018822673091776602, "c": 1, "size": 13.0, "bold": false}], "source": "pdf text layer"}